Continuing, NanoCoat received much more work. Virtually all of it was
foundational for it. Monitor entering and exiting, static field initialization,
reference queues, MLE improvements, instance field access, temporary character
sequences, invalid bytecode checking, more MLE implementations, `lookupswitch`,
