virtual method re-lookup to invoke the correct method, basis for JVM and JNI
compatibility layers, stack bytecodes, POSIX signal catchers when debugging,
trace points, stack dumps, thread scheduling, exception handling, float and
double comparison, `multianewarray`, and atomic improvements.

On the otherwise, `WeakReference` was refactored to be simpler and to remove
an issue that has been around for a very long time where it would just get
stuck in a loop checking itself. Also, `ObjectShelf.arrayClone()` was added
which effectively makes array cloning faster. RMS was additionally 100%
implemented, making it the first to reach such.

