In the second half of the month:

At this time, the CI/CD pipelines on CircleCI were completely falling apart
and there was not much I could do to fix them. My goal with this was to have
an independent build system that could build the entirety of SquirrelJME and
run on any system or setup. Rather than duplicating the rules to every build
system, I just have an outer build system which is called by a pipeline. This
is so I can have whatever setup I want. There were also a bunch of compilation
fixes as now everything was being built. I wrote a system and compiler
